        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">One-party state</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1918 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Power held by</span><span class="info-stat-val">The ruling party’s leadership, usually a politburo or central committee and the party leader, whose decisions the organs of the state carry out</span></div>
